# A font is someone's licensed work, and most of the good-looking ones may not be passed on.
# So: nothing in here ships EXCEPT the one open-licensed family we are allowed to give away,
# named file by file. An allow-list rather than a block-list, because the cost of getting it
# wrong is one-directional -- a font that fails to ship is a missing file, a font that ships
# without the right to is a licence violation in a public repository, on someone else's work.
# Guarded by tests/test_only_free_fonts_ship.py, which reads what git actually tracks.
fonts/*
!fonts/NotoSansThai-Regular.ttf
!fonts/OFL-NotoSansThai.txt
!fonts/PUT-FONTS-HERE.txt
font-comparison.png
settings.json

# OCR scratch from the local reader; derived, never shipped.
_ocr/
